sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner
    participant Acct as Accounting Program
    participant Archive as Digital Archive
    participant Store as Archive Store
    participant Audit as Audit Log
    participant Backup as Portable Hard Disk

    alt Manual capture — incoming bill, contract, bank document, scanned paper
        Owner->>Archive: Add PDF file
        Archive-->>Owner: Request metadata
        Owner->>Archive: Date, Category, Name + optional Description, Amount
        Archive->>Archive: Validate required fields
        alt Required field missing
            Archive-->>Owner: Reject with validation message
        else Fields complete
            Archive->>Store: Write unalterable copy
            Archive->>Audit: Record capture event
            Archive-->>Owner: Confirm archived
        end
    else Weekly batch — outgoing invoices
        Acct->>Archive: Weekly PDF export batch
        Archive->>Archive: Index each invoice by customer, date, amount
        Archive->>Store: Write unalterable copies
        Archive->>Audit: Record capture and batch outcome
        Archive-->>Owner: Surface any failed transfers for action
    end

    Note over Store,Backup: Weekly backup to single portable disk — RPO 7 days
    Store->>Backup: Copy archive
